-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">打</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">电</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">话</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">问</span>路</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:6px\">Chén Yáo kāichē mílù, tíngchē dǎ diànhuà wènlù</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">천야오가 운전하다 길을 잃어, 차를 세우고 전화를 걸어 길을 물었습니다.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #A8792B;font-size:15px;color:#24272E;line-height:1.7;word-break:keep-all\">오늘 배운 打电话가 문장 뒤쪽에서 &#x27;전화를 걸다&#x27;라는 동작으로 그대로 쓰였습니다.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">打电话</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">dǎ diànhuà</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">전화를 걸다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">开车</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">kāichē</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">차를 운전하다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">迷路</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">mílù</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">길을 잃다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">停车</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">tíngchē</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">차를 세우다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">问路</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">wènlù</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">길을 묻다</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">이 문장 듣기</div>\n<p><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day49-news.mp3\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px\"><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day49-news.mp3\">소리 내려받기</a></audio></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#767469\">출처 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE9aV3hxOUdOWmpTRkNmd0kzeUZPQ09VYVNRaVVTb3V1aFc4c3FLaENEaE55UkVncGU5TmRrZHBkaDVHdFBUU3FJSjUyaVBxNmhaUW1vcDZaVUtROXh2TktCWWk4eG9OZm9XNEluRHJzUXRLUUU?oc=5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#767469\">新浪网</a> · 기사 제목 한 줄만 인용했습니다</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#FDF6E7\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:10px\">오늘 배운 것</div>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">打电话</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">dǎ diànhuà</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">전화를 걸다 (동사구)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">喂</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">wéi</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">여보세요 (전화 받을 때 하는 말)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">电话号码</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">diànhuà hàomǎ</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">전화번호 (명사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">手机</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">shǒujī</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">휴대폰 (명사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">给</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">gěi</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">~에게 (전치사), 주다 (동사)</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E1D8;margin:30px 0 0;padding:16px 0 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">지난 수업</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/?p=2697\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#8C6423;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all\">← 多少钱·块·贵·便宜 값 묻고 깎는 말 (중국어 48일차)</a></p>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-top:8px\">하루 한 편씩 쌓는 중입니다. 오늘이 49일차입니다. <a href=\"https://daytip.kr/chinese-course/\" style=\"color:#8C6423\">전체 목차 →</a></div>\n</div>\n",
